    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "HWP Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 13 Fortunes Lawn to the market, a superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom ground floor apartment situated within this highly sought-after and well-maintained residential development in the heart of Citywest.\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this spacious apartment offers bright and contemporary accommodation designed for modern living. The welcoming entrance hall leads to a generous open-plan living and dining area, creating a comfortable space to relax or entertain. The modern fitted kitchen is well-appointed with ample storage and workspace, while large windows allow natural light to flood the living areas.\n\nThe property comprises two spacious double bedrooms, including a generous principal bedroom complete with an en-suite bathroom. A stylish main bathroom and excellent storage throughout further enhance the practicality and appeal of this impressive home. The ground floor position provides easy access and added convenience, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers, investors, or those seeking accessible accommodation.\n\nFortunes Lawn enjoys an enviable location with an exceptional range of amenities on its doorstep. Citywest Shopping Centre, cafes, restaurants, supermarkets, and leisure facilities are all within walking distance. The area is also home to excellent schools, parks, and recreational amenities, making it a popular choice for professionals and families alike.\n\nCommuters are exceptionally well catered for, with the nearby Luas Red Line providing direct access to Dublin City Centre, while the N7, M50, and extensive Dublin Bus routes ensure excellent connectivity throughout Dublin and beyond. Citywest Business Campus is also just minutes away, making this an ideal location for those working in the area.\n\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a turnkey apartment in one of Dublin's most convenient and rapidly growing residential locations.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment through HWP Estate Agents. \n\nProperties in this highly desirable development rarely remain on the market for long, so interested parties are encouraged to arrange a viewing at their earliest convenience.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "* Bright open-plan living and dining area\n* Modern fitted kitchen\n* Principal bedroom with en-suite bathroom\n* Well-maintained development\n* Ground floor position offering easy access\n* Excellent storage throughout\n* Walking distance to Luas Red Line\n* Close to Citywest Shopping Centre, schools, cafés and local amenities\n* Easy access to the N7, M50 and Citywest Business Campus\n* Ideal for first-time buyers, investors or those looking to downsize\n\n\n"
